OL,3,ABurnham to unveil public body to invest
OL,4,Ain electricity grid
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham is expected to put the
OL,7,Fproposals at the heart of a new goal to
OL,8,Fbring UK energy costs in line with
OL,9,Fother nations in Europe within ten
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FHe will promise to have an "honest
OL,13,Fconversation" with the public and take
OL,14,Fon the "difficult issues" that have
OL,15,Fbeen ignored for too long.
